    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i feel really weird. im type 1 and im super thirsty like i cant stop drinking water and im feeling kind of sick to my stomach too. my bf says my breath smells kinda like nail polish remover or something fruity? i think i might just be dehydrated or my sugar is just acting up. do u think i should just drink a bunch of water and try to nap it off?",
