      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait r u sure?? it just feels like a bad crash. i already checked my sugar and it's a bit high but not crazy high. i really dont want to go to the hospital if i dont have to, the wait times are insane and im just really tired. can i just take some extra insulin now and sleep it off? wouldnt that fix it?",
